# `agents.grant`

Grant restricted capabilities to an agent (operator approval). Upgrades the agent's live sessions; the next gated call passes. C3 — operator-only, the human-in-the-loop approval point.

**Policy** — command `[C3_CRITICAL]`. Capability `ship.agents.grant`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `agent` | `string` |
| `grants` | `string[]` |

## Returns

`GrantResult` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `agent` | `string` |
| `grants` | `string[]` |
| `provisioned` | `string[]` |
| `sessions_upgraded` | `number` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.grant --json '{ "agent": "", "grants": [] }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "agent": "rust-lane",
  "grants": [
    "ship.git"
  ],
  "provisioned": [
    "ship.git",
    "ship.runtime"
  ],
  "sessions_upgraded": 1
}
```
